[{"id":185019817,"discussion_id":"fba1c834e6c1aaa23bf3928ce902b04a031f57c2","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n该 PR 修复了 `SoftMarginLossGrad` 反向计算在 `mean` 场景下的溢出问题。核心改动是调整 `arch35/soft_margin_loss_grad.h` 内核中的计算顺序：不再先计算导数与梯度 `g` 的乘积、再乘以系数 `cof_`，而是先对梯度 `g` 执行 `Muls(g, g, cof_, count)` 缩放，再与导数相乘。这样在 `mean` 模式下可以降低中间结果的数值范围，避免先乘后缩导致的溢出。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **非 `mean` 分支调整乘法顺序**：将原来的 `Mul(x, x, g, count)` 后再 `Muls(x, x, cof_, count)`，改为先 `Muls(g, g, cof_, count)` 缩放梯度，再 `Mul(x, x, g, count)` 与导数相乘。\n- **`mean` 分支调整乘法顺序并保持结果写回 `BG`**：将原来的 `Mul(x, x, g, count)` 后再 `Muls(g, x, cof_, count)`，改为先 `Muls(g, g, cof_, count)` 缩放梯度，再 `Mul(g, x, g, count)` 将结果写回 `BG`。\n- **更新注释以说明缩放时机**：在代码中补充 “scale grad first to avoid mean overflow” 和 “mean: scale grad before multiplying the derivative” 等注释，明确提前缩放梯度的目的。\n\n","created_at":"2026-08-16T17:21:36+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-16T17:25:05+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":185019818,"discussion_id":"115a82538b80fe18c3e16f807b942f20bdf45595","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-08-16T17:21:36+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-16T17:40:58+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":185019828,"discussion_id":"3ac15d5616d73367162df21e8b9bdd99fb50a021","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6